OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA clear and
OL,6,Fchilly night for most places, with an
OL,7,Fair frost possible in rural spots.
OL,8,FCloudier, with showers lingering along
OL,9,Fthe coast, where it will remain milder.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FA clear and chilly start
OL,12,Fwith frost in rural spots inland,
OL,13,Fchance of showers along the coast.
OL,14,FCloud gradually thickens throughout
OL,15,Fthe day, rain and stronger winds
OL,16,Farriving by evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
