OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain
OL,6,Fclears Friday morning with blustery
OL,7,Fshowers and sunny spells to follow.
OL,8,FRemaining showery and breezy on
OL,9,FSaturday. Becoming drier and more
OL,10,Fsettled on Sunday.
